<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-weishu-weishou" book-id="b-weishu-weishou-047" chapter-id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen" source-id="s-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen">
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen:lineage" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen:lineage:m0000" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBAAAA">盧玄</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen:lineage:m0004" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBAAAA">子真</persName>，范陽涿人也。曾袓<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen:lineage:m0015" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>，晉司空<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen:lineage:m0020" ref="b21_e55_8bd">劉琨</persName>從事中郎。袓<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen:lineage:m0028" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBAA">偃</persName>，父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-047-jin044-luchen:lineage:m0031" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBAAA">邈</persName>，並仕慕容氏為郡太守，皆以儒雅稱。</p>
</text>
